<!--more-->

### Introduction to Hugo
Static site generators are great tools for creating fast, lightweight web content. One such open-source tool is Hugo, a static site generator written in Go (Golang). Its primary advantage is speed. Hugo generates static HTML files and thus loads even faster on a visitor's machine, reducing latency.

Hugo is easy to learn and perfect for small to medium-sized sites. Its performance for large sites, excellent template system, and extensive shortcodes also make it preferred by web developers.

In this article, we will cover the basics of Hugo. We will start by installing Hugo and generate a simple website. We'--------------------            //Assert.IsFalse(New_Ret);
