This is a rough introduction to automated testing and how we can apply it to resolve common issues. However, the field of automation testing goes deeper with continuous integration/continuous deployment, refactoring testing, software requirements testing, acceptance criteria testing, UI-automation & more.
For professional and more comprehensive testing strategies, consulting with experienced testers or testing services might be beneficial.

Please find your own understanding and guidance by your own tests. It is a process, not a tool, and learning to fully utilize this process requires time and practice. Happy Testing and keep growing :)
